    "title": "Johnson County priest resigns amid criminal investigation, archdiocese says - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Delaney Eyermann ,\n1 days ago KANSAS CITY, Mo. — A Johnson County priest has resigned amid a criminal investigation, the Archdiocese of Kansas City announced Wednesday. According to a statement on the archdiocese’s website, Father Richard Storey decided to resign as the pastor of Curé of Ars Catholic Church in Leawood on Wednesday. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 42",
